{"chapter": "categories", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "04AN", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{C}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:60933e2eb73b5869424ecf69d90b96f339f85ff45ff143b7b9fe9b3e0ad8de56", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1e1947d81e98ab030c96b34c82ec3bd73d9f813a9428aa39e59a316b080dd0dd", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nWe use this terminology to distinguish this notion from the notion\nof ``having coproducts'' or ``having finite coproducts'' which usually means\nsomething else (in particular it always implies there exists an\ninitial object in <MATH_0001>).\n\n\n\n\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a0e892667e0caf9e45e8752b0d11c8f61b3ab89b9e3088037ede1c0b124b8c78", "unit_id": "tag:04AN:prose-0002"}
